’re proud to announce a new multi-year partnership with the Seahawks as the team’s Official Fan-to-Fan Payments & Exclusive Digital Ticket Payment Processing Partner — marking PayPal’s first NFL club partnership following our broader work with the league.​\n\nThis collaboration is all about elevating the gameday experience for the 12s. PayPal is now the presenting partner of the Seahawks Gameday Experience Program, giving fans access to unforgettable moments like pregame field passes, on-field access during player introductions, postgame press conferences, and more.​ Learn more: https://t.co/pdVFSel4F8\n\nAny Seahawks fans reading this? 👀",entity_set:$R[701]={__ref:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MjU5MTYxNzA2MzczMTI=:entity_set"},id:"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MjU5MTYxNzA2MzczMTI="},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MjU5MTYxNzA2MzczMTI=:entity_set":$R[702]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MjU5MTYxNzA2MzczMTI=:entity_set",__typename:"EntitySet",hashtags:$R[703]={__refs:$R[704]=[]},symbols:$R[705]={__refs:$R[706]=[]},smarttags:$R[707]={__refs:$R[708]=[]},urls:$R[709]={__refs:$R[710]=["client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MjU5MTYxNzA2MzczMTI=:entity_set:urls:0"]},user_mentions:$R[711]={__refs:$R[712]=[]}},"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MjU5MTYxNzA2MzczMTI=:entity_set:urls:0":$R[713]={__id:"client:Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwNTM4MjU5MTYxNzA2MzczMTI=:entity_set:urls:0",__typename:"UrlsEntity",display_url:"bit.ly/3Pz1BQb",expanded_url:"https://bit.ly/3Pz1BQb",indices:$R[714]=[684,707],url:"https://t.co/pdVFSel4F8"},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzgyNTkxNjM0MjUzMDI1Nw==:grok_translated_post_with_availability":$R[715]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzgyNTkxNjM0MjUzMDI1Nw==:grok_translated_post_with_availability",__typename:"ApiGrokTranslateResponse",is_available:!1,data:null},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzgyNTkxNjM0MjUzMDI1Nw==:edit_control":$R[716]={__id:"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzgyNTkxNjM0MjUzMDI1Nw==:edit_control",__typename:"EditControlInitial",edit_tweet_ids:$R[717]=["2053825916342530257"]},"client:VHdlZXQ6MjA1MzgyNTkxNjM0MjUzMDI1Nw==: